---
# Inherits the project configuration and relaxes one check for test bodies.
#
# readability-function-cognitive-complexity counts the expansion of gtest's assertion macros, not
# the code a reader sees. A three-line test that loops over devices and calls EXPECT_EQ scores over
# the threshold while being entirely legible, so the check measures the wrong thing here.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: "-readability-function-cognitive-complexity"
